  "strategy_assumptions": [
    "Debt principal carries the reconciled June 30 $6,753,703,000, including $6,713,659,000 convertible principal and $40,044,000 other secured debt. No subsequent financing change was identified; the fresh rounded issuer KPI only covers convertibles and is not a replacement.",
    "Preferred share counts roll the September 14 audit through 1,771,238 STRC shares repurchased. The September 21 weekly filing reports no ATM issuance and no other preferred repurchases.",
    "Unchanged STRF/STRK/STRD/STRE shares and no unreported non-ATM issuance are assumptions. STRE retains EUR100 preference under the no post-IPO issuance premise.",
    "September 20 is Sunday; base preferences use the September 18 business date and ten unadjusted closes strictly before September 18. STRF issuance branch is assumed inactive; all three weekly filings covering the lookback report zero ATM issuance.",
    "Assumes scheduled September 15 STRC dividend was paid. Its amended certificate accumulates regular dividends from the day after the last paid payment date, giving September 16-20 accrual of 5/360 at $12 annually. September rate of 12% is confirmed by the issuer dividend table. Scheduled payment is not independently verified settlement.",
    "Quarterly June 30-September 20 accrual is 80/360 for STRF, STRK, STRE and the previously declared STRD dividend, assuming scheduled June 30 payments were paid.",
    "Ending-share accrual is an estimate, not an exact paying-agent liability, and does not establish record-holder entitlements after repurchase."
  ],
